135 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 105 0 R
/T (The sample is nearly evenly split by gender, with slightly more men than women. Seniors and middle aged adults make up most of participants, and majority of respondents have a partner. Most participants report their mental health to be relatively good across all age groups. Most people feel their mental health status have not changed much for the past 12 months. Overall, the data suggests that self-perceived health tends to decline with age, though a significant portion of older adults still consider their health to be good or very good.)
/E (The sample is nearly evenly split by gender, with slightly more men than women. Seniors and middle aged adults make up most of participants, and majority of respondents have a partner. Most participants report their mental health to be relatively good across all age groups. Most people feel their mental health status have not changed much for the past 12 months. Overall, the data suggests that self-perceived health tends to decline with age, though a significant portion of older adults still consider their health to be good or very good.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [24]
>>
